 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the sixth month in Nazareth, a town of Galilee",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God sent the angel Gabriel to a girl of low degree",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Promised to a man named Joseph, from the house of David's line",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the virgin's name was Mary, and the hour was God's design",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Greetings, you who are favored! The Lord is with you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She was deeply troubled and she wondered at his word",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid, Mary; you have found favor with God",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will conceive and give birth to a son, and you are to name him Jesus",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the Lord's servant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the Lord's servant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will be great and will be called the Son of the Most High",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will reign over the house of Jacob forever",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His kingdom will never end",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How will this be, she asked him, how can it come to be",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Holy Spirit will come upon you, said the angel tenderly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the Lord's servant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the Lord's servant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And consider your relative Elizabeth",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In her old age with a son",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For nothing will be impossible with God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
